<title>MEXICO: Grupo Carso buys stake in Sears de Mexico--dealers.</title>
<headline>Grupo Carso buys stake in Sears de Mexico--dealers.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican holding company Grupo Carso SA has bought a stake in retailer Sears de Mexico, traders on the Mexican Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The dealers said the Bolsa announced the deal minutes before trading began.</p>
<p>Sears, Roebuck and Co, the corporate parent of Sears de Mexico, announced the pact simultaneously in the U.S.</p>
<p>((--David Luhnow, Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9565))</p>
